When `this.n1 >= this.n2` is true, **`n1` has ALREADY beaten `n2`** (so `n2` is eliminated — `n2` can't win inside this first block!).
Now `n1` just plays against `n3`:
* If **`this.n1 >= this.n3`** $\rightarrow$ **`n1` wins!** (`this.n = this.n1 + " is the largest number.";`)
* `else` $\rightarrow$ **`n3` wins!** (`this.n = this.n3 + " is the largest number.";`)

